# Keys of the niri feel (feels/niri.lua), shown first in the Keybinds cheat sheet while it's active.
# Format: KEYS | description. Arrows and H J K L do the same.

SUPER + ←/→ or H/L              | Focus the column left / right
SUPER + ↑/↓ or K/J              | Focus the window above / below in the column
SUPER + CTRL + ←/→ or H/L       | Move the column left / right
SUPER + CTRL + ↑/↓ or K/J       | Move the window up / down in its column
SUPER + Home / End              | Focus the first / last column
SUPER + CTRL + Home / End       | Move the column to the start / end
SUPER + [ / ]                   | Push the window into the column left / right (or out of its column)
SUPER + ,                       | Take the next column's top window into this column
SUPER + .                       | Push the bottom window out into its own column
SUPER + R / SHIFT + R           | Column width: next / previous preset (⅓ · ½ · ⅔)
SUPER + - / =                   | Column width −10 % / +10 %
SUPER + SHIFT + - / =           | Window height −10 % / +10 % (in a column)
SUPER + F                       | Maximize the column (again: back to its width)
SUPER + CTRL + F                | Expand the column to fill the free space
SUPER + SHIFT + F               | Fullscreen
SUPER + C                       | Center the column
SUPER + Page_Down / U           | Workspace below (a new one under the last)
SUPER + Page_Up / I             | Workspace above
SUPER + CTRL + Page_Down / U    | Move the window to the workspace below
SUPER + CTRL + Page_Up / I      | Move the window to the workspace above
SUPER + SHIFT + Page_Down / U   | Swap this workspace with the one below
SUPER + SHIFT + Page_Up / I     | Swap this workspace with the one above
SUPER + 1…9                     | Go to workspace N
SUPER + CTRL + 1…9              | Move the window to workspace N
SUPER + Tab                     | Previous workspace
SUPER + SHIFT + ←/→/↑/↓         | Focus the monitor that way
SUPER + SHIFT + CTRL + arrows   | Move the window to the monitor that way
SUPER + wheel ↑/↓               | Workspace above / below
SUPER + SHIFT + wheel           | Focus columns left / right
SUPER + CTRL + wheel            | Move the window to the workspace above / below
SUPER + O (or top-left corner)  | Overview
SUPER + Q                       | Close the window
SUPER + SHIFT + V               | Switch focus between floating and tiled windows
SUPER + W                       | Window group (tabs), niri's tabbed column
SUPER + T                       | Terminal
SUPER + ALT + L                 | Lock (SUPER + L is focus right here)
SUPER + ALT + W                 | Wallpaper picker (SUPER + K is focus up here)
SUPER + SHIFT + /               | This cheat sheet
3 fingers ←/→                   | Scroll the strip of columns
3 fingers ↑/↓                   | Workspace above / below
4 fingers ↑/↓                   | Overview
